{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:Observations.HiggsT28","@type":"LeanModule","name":"Observations.HiggsT28","imports":["lean:module:Init"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:higgs_three_colors","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"higgs_three_colors","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/higgs-t28.lean#L71-L75","doc":"**CONDITIONAL THEOREM.** If the Higgs-as-T(2,8) conjecture holds,\nthen the Higgs boson has exactly 3 color degrees of freedom\n(one per exceptional divisor). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:t28_genus_eq_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"t28_genus_eq_three","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/higgs-t28.lean#L65-L69","doc":"**THEOREM (special case).** The genus of T(2,8) = 3.\nThis closes the `t28_genus` field of the conjecture — it's\nthe one sub-claim that's provable without the full conjecture. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HiggsT28.higgs_t28_conjecture","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HiggsT28.higgs_t28_conjecture","kind":"instance","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/higgs-t28.lean#L48-L54","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HiggsT28.HiggsAsT28.uniqueness","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HiggsT28.HiggsAsT28.uniqueness","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/higgs-t28.lean#L45-L45","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HiggsT28.HiggsAsT28.spans_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HiggsT28.HiggsAsT28.spans_three","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/higgs-t28.lean#L44-L44","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HiggsT28.HiggsAsT28.t28_genus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HiggsT28.HiggsAsT28.t28_genus","kind":"theorem","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/higgs-t28.lean#L43-L43","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HiggsT28.HiggsAsT28.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HiggsT28.HiggsAsT28.mk","kind":"ctor","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/higgs-t28.lean#L42-L42","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HiggsT28.HiggsAsT28","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HiggsT28.HiggsAsT28","kind":"class","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/higgs-t28.lean#L39-L45","doc":"**Higgs-as-T(2,8) conjecture** (class-axiomatised per §3b-cond).\nAlgebraic/topological tier — numerical Higgs-mass evaluation\ndeferred to a future Archimedean tier. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:higgs-t28","label":"conj:higgs-t28","md":"quantum-observable-universe/observations/higgs-t28.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HiggsT28.T28UniquenessHolds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HiggsT28.T28UniquenessHolds","kind":"opaque","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/higgs-t28.lean#L34-L37","doc":"**Sub-claim (uniqueness)**: `T(2, 8)` is the unique torus\nlink on Bring's surface whose Seifert surface achieves the\nthree-divisor span. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HiggsT28.T28SpansAllThreeDivisorsHolds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HiggsT28.T28SpansAllThreeDivisorsHolds","kind":"opaque","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/higgs-t28.lean#L30-L32","doc":"**Sub-claim (spanning)**: the Seifert surface of `T(2, 8)`\nspans `D_r ∪ D_g ∪ D_b` simultaneously. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HiggsT28.T28GenusHolds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HiggsT28.T28GenusHolds","kind":"opaque","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/higgs-t28.lean#L26-L28","doc":"**Sub-claim (genus)**: `T(2, 8)` has Seifert-surface genus 3,\nmatching the count of color tubes / exceptional divisors. ","signatureChunk":0}]}